# ASB-001 — Admin surface bootstrap

**Authority:** EPH Track III · complements [platform-surface-cohesion.mdoc](./platform-surface-cohesion.mdoc) § 2b.

Admin (`apps/web`) resolves tenant context through the same guest-surface-host chain as marketing and portal, with operator session overlay.

## Contract

```text
resolveAdminBootstrapForWebHost(host)
  → resolveAdminBootstrapForHost (packages/guest-surface-host)
       ├─ resolveTenantIdFromDevHost(host, "admin")
       ├─ fetchPublicTenantContextForHost
       └─ dev allowed ? devFallbackTenantId() : throw ADMIN_TENANT_UNRESOLVED
```

## Implementation map

| Layer | Module |
| ----- | ------ |
| GSH | `packages/guest-surface-host/src/resolve-admin-surface-bootstrap.ts` |
| Web wrapper | `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-admin-bootstrap.server.ts` |
| Layout kernel | `apps/web/src/tenant/tenant-kernel.server.ts` |
| Request overlay | `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-request-bootstrap.server.ts` — `resolveRequestBootstrapAppSession` |
| Identity BFF | `apps/web/src/auth/identity-bff-headers.ts` |

## Operator app shell (`(app)/layout`)

Authenticated operator chrome (nav enablement, wizardCreate / financeNav warm caches, `OperatorShell.pluginId`) **must** resolve bootstrap via `resolveRequestBootstrapAppSession()`:

```text
resolveRequestBootstrapAppSession()
  → resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHost(host)          # anonymous / pre-cookie baseline
  → if session cookie valid:
       resolveBootstrapAppSession(JWT claims, host)  # tenant_id → pluginId (UUID map)
```

**Why:** Under `next start` (`NODE_ENV=production`), guest `isDevGuestHostAllowed` keeps the PHASE_43 host→tenant map closed. Bare `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHost` then falls through to env starter defaults, while the signed operator JWT still maps to Denali — shell/nav would seed `starter` and hide Users/Finance / flat-edit extended chrome. JWT overlay keeps ASB/host guest behavior for unauthenticated requests and does not widen guest host permissions.

Root layout (`app/layout.tsx`) remains on `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHostAsync` (ASB-001) plus its own JWT rebind for body/`AppProviders` — separate from the operator shell path above.

## Forbidden

- Direct `fetchPublicTenantContextForHost` in web kernel with env fallback when API returns null (fail-soft).
- Duplicate tenant resolution logic outside GSH + thin web wrapper.
- Operator `(app)/layout` using bare `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHost` for shell/nav/capability warm (session cookie present).

## Guards + specs

- `guard:surface-cohesion` — kernel + identity BFF import ASB wrapper.
- `apps/web/test/admin-bootstrap-parity.spec.ts`
- `apps/web/test/identity-bff-asb.spec.ts`
- `apps/web/test/session-host-binding-multilevel.spec.ts`

## Branding

Unchanged — `fetchPublicTenantBrandingForHost` on login/settings; bootstrap supplies `tenantId` + `pluginId` only.
